# Battle against Moltres (the legendary bird of fire): a proud trumpet fanfare in G minor over horns and strings, the
# dotted wingbeat pounded out by timpani and tuba. Original composition for this game.
title Battle! Moltres
tempo 168
meter 4/4
lowhptempo 1.08
reverb 0.3

track lead trumpet lowhp=sawlead vol=0.72 pan=0 rev=0.28
  r1 | o4 d8. d16 g8. g16 o5 d2 |
  L o4 d4 g4. a8 b-4 | o5 b-2 g4 e-4 | o5 f4. e-8 d4 c4 | o5 d2 r8 f+8 a8 o6 c8 |
